c6f7c4b5-8dbb-46b8-ba21-31daaf232537-0
00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:56.246
Quando você clica nesse botão e pega lá,
né,

c6f7c4b5-8dbb-46b8-ba21-31daaf232537-1
00:03:56.246 --> 00:04:00.792
